      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. I'm a little worried, though, that the part about the lateness sounds a bit too blunt or harsh for someone who is otherwise a top performer. I don't want them to feel like I'm attacking their character. Is there a way to phrase the feedback on punctuality so it feels a bit more... I don't know, lighthearted or less heavy-handed, while still making it clear it's an issue?",
